WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.678
Step 1. On the referral page, go to the Appointment and visit section.

1.2
00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:07.271
You can start a walk-in consultation now,

1.3
00:00:07.271 --> 00:00:10.617
or book an appointment for a scheduled visit.

2.1
00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:15.885
Step 3. Select Book appointment, choose a practitioner, a day, and a slot,

2.2
00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:18.055
then select Confirm Appointment.

2.3
00:00:18.055 --> 00:00:29.137
The calendar shows how many slots are left on each day.

3.1
00:00:29.137 --> 00:00:34.355
Step 4. Check the Referral appointment panel, then select Return to referral.

3.2
00:00:34.355 --> 00:00:40.211
Care links the appointment to the referral, and Appointment and visit now shows it.
